<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile offers additional ferro-columbium.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile offers additional ferro-columbium.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center has been authorized to sell an additional 142,000 lbs of ferro-columbium for fiscal year 1997 ending Sept 30, the agency said Wedensday.</p>
<p>Bids are scheduled for Aug 12.</p>
<p>The stockpile has sold 58,000 lb so far this fiscal year.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
